### Pricing Calculator API — VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### Click "Send Request" above any block. Cookies persist between requests
### automatically, so run "login" once and the authed requests work.

# Switch to the live URL by swapping the comment on these two lines:
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@baseUrl = https://multi-rate-pricing-calculator-serve-psi.vercel.app

### Health — expect {"ok":true,"db":true}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Login as the seeded demo user — expect 200, sets the session cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "demo1234"
}

### Who am I — expect 200 with demo@example.com (run login first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Logout — expect 204; running "Who am I" again now gives 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

### Signup a new account — expect 201 (edit the email to rerun, else 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "neel@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login with wrong password — expect 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Signup with weak password — expect 400 with the specific message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "weak@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}

### Unknown endpoint — expect JSON 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nope
